# TEEFAHS CLOTHIER — COMPLETE E-COMMERCE TRANSFORMATION, PRODUCT PRESENTATION REBUILD, INTERNATIONAL SHOPPING EXPERIENCE AND PRODUCTION FUNCTIONALITY REPAIR

## PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Transform the existing Teefahs Clothier website into a world-class, international-standard modest-fashion e-commerce platform.

The target experience should have the product-discovery depth, detailed product presentation, shopping convenience and customer confidence associated with major international shopping platforms such as Temu, Amazon and other established e-commerce websites.

However, Teefahs Clothier must retain its own premium, elegant, luxurious and distinctive fashion identity.

This is not a request to copy another website. It is a request to build a genuinely professional shopping experience that meets international customer expectations.

The website must serve customers in Nigeria and the international diaspora, including customers in the UK, USA, Canada and other countries.

**The most important objective:** Customers must be able to understand exactly what they are buying, select the correct product options, place orders and follow their orders without needing to contact the store owner for information that should already be available on the website.

The owner must also be able to manage products, images, variations, inventory and orders independently through a real, reliable admin dashboard.

This is a production improvement, not a demonstration or prototype.

